@startuml
title Combat Map 공간 이동 해결 구조\nUC-02~07 · BR-01~19 · ADR-018
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "Combat Map 정본" {
  class CombatMap {
    +validatePath(path)
    +advanceOneCell(step)
    +commitResolution(result)
    -version
    -tokens
    -spatialFeatures
    -visibility
  }
  class SpatialFeature {
    -featureId
    -cells
    -state
    -trigger
    -provenance
  }
  class MovementResolutionEngine {
    +prepare(operation, checkResult)
    +requestCheck(step)
    +prepareResult(operation)
  }
  class SpatialTriggerResolver {
    +resolve(stepContext)
  }
  class HostileObservationResolver {
    +resolve(stepContext)
  }
  interface LineOfSightQuery {
    +query(origin, target, blockers)
  }
  class VisibilityPolicy {
    +project(playerOrigin, map)
  }
  CombatMap *-- "0..*" SpatialFeature : 공간 요소는 aggregate 내부 entity
  MovementResolutionEngine --> CombatMap : 단계별 primitive 사용
  MovementResolutionEngine --> SpatialTriggerResolver
  MovementResolutionEngine --> HostileObservationResolver
  SpatialTriggerResolver --> LineOfSightQuery
  HostileObservationResolver --> LineOfSightQuery
  VisibilityPolicy --> LineOfSightQuery
}

package "Combat Map application layer" {
  class MovementResolutionOperation {
    -commandId
    -fingerprint
    -baseVersion
    -requestedPath
    -cursor
    -status
    -priorActiveState
    -pendingCheck
    -results
    -result
  }
  interface MovementResolutionOperationRepository {
    +reserve(operation)
    +loadById(operationId)
    +save(operation)
    +cancel(operationId)
  }
  class MovementResolutionCoordinator {
    +start(request)
    +resume(request)
    +query(query)
    +cancel(request)
  }
  MovementResolutionCoordinator --> MovementResolutionOperationRepository
  MovementResolutionCoordinator --> MovementResolutionEngine
  MovementResolutionCoordinator --> CombatMap : 최종 로컬 트랜잭션 조정
  MovementResolutionOperationRepository --> MovementResolutionOperation
  MovementResolutionOperation --> CombatMap : mapId/baseVersion 참조
}

package "Adventure Runtime" {
  class MapMovementCoordinator {
    +preview(request)
    +start(request)
    +resume(request)
  }
  interface CombatMapPort {
    +preview(MovementPreviewRequest request)
    +start(MovementStartRequest request)
    +resume(MovementResumeRequest request)
    +query(MovementOperationQuery query)
    +cancel(MovementCancelRequest request)
  }
  MapMovementCoordinator --> CombatMapPort
}

package "외부 소유 경계" {
  class "Dice Roll" as DiceRoll <<경계>>
  class "Character Management" as CharacterManagement <<경계>>
  MapMovementCoordinator --> DiceRoll : 판정 조정
  MapMovementCoordinator --> CharacterManagement : commit 이후 Saga
}

CombatMapPort ..> MovementResolutionCoordinator : 내부 HTTP adapter
note right of MovementResolutionOperation
  durable application work record
  플레이어 판정 대기·재시작·멱등 replay 보존
  새 bounded context/service/module 아님
end note
note bottom of CombatMap
  지도·공간 요소·시야·탐험의 정본
  최종 commit에서 위치·공간 요소·visibility·version·결과/history 원자 반영
end note
note "의존 방향: Adventure Runtime → CombatMapPort → Combat Map application/domain\nDomain은 HTTP·DB·AI에 의존하지 않음; Combat Map이 숨은 상태를 Adventure에 복제하지 않음\n추적성: UC-02~07 · BR-01~19 · ADR-018" as N1
N1 .. MovementResolutionEngine
@enduml
